    "title": "Starlink",
    "description": "Starlink is designed to deliver high-speed broadband internet to locations where access has been unreliable, expensive, or completely unavailable.\r\n\r\nThe Starlink app is here to help you:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Identify the install location that will ensure the best quality of service\r\n\u2022 Check for obstructions that can interfere with service\r\n\u2022 Setup your Starlink hardware\r\n\u2022 Verify your WiFi connection\r\n\u2022 Receive alerts for service issues\r\n\u2022 Access your connectivity statistics\r\n\u2022 Identify devices connected to your network\r\n\u2022 Troubleshoot connectivity issues\r\n\u2022 Contact support",
